@*
    Where signing out lands.

    Anonymous on purpose: /auth/logout drops the cookie and then redirects here, so this has to
    render without a session. It sits under /auth rather than on the root because the root is not
    routed — this server's public surface is the versioned API, and a login screen is not what a bare
    request to it should answer with.
*@
@page "/auth/signed-out"
@layout SignedOutLayout
@inject AdminAuthMode AuthMode

@* Empty-state anatomy, style guide §4.2: medallion, heading, helper line, action. *@
<div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6 py-12 text-center sm:gap-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
        <div class="bg-muted text-muted-foreground flex size-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl sm:size-20">
            <Glyph Name="IconName.LogIn" Class="size-8 sm:size-10"/>
        </div>

        @*
            Reached with a session only by navigating here directly, which is worth answering
            honestly: claiming the session ended when it has not would send someone off to hunt for a
            logout that already appeared to work.
        *@
        <AuthorizeView>
            <Authorized>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-medium sm:text-2xl">Still signed in</h3>
                <p class="text-muted-foreground text-base sm:text-lg">
                    This session belongs to <span class="font-medium">@context.User.Identity?.Name</span>.
                </p>
            </Authorized>
            <NotAuthorized>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-medium sm:text-2xl">Signed out</h3>
                <p class="text-muted-foreground text-base sm:text-lg">
                    Your admin session has ended.
                </p>
            </NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>

        @*
            Says so plainly rather than leaving the page to look broken: with the bypass on there is
            no session to end, so signing out lands here still authenticated every time.
        *@
        @if (AuthMode.DevBypass)
        {
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-base sm:text-lg">
                Authentication is disabled on this server, so there is no session to end.
            </p>
        }
    </div>

    <div>
        <AuthorizeView>
            <Authorized>
                <BbButton Href="/admin">Administration</BbButton>
            </Authorized>
            <NotAuthorized>
                <BbButton Href="/auth/login">Sign in again</BbButton>
            </NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </div>
</div>
